<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And now I’m walking by the Spirit,</l><l>Marching on toward the goal.</l><l>O Lord, Your purpose</l><l>Means everything to me.</l><l>All self-love I lay aside</l><l>For the churches, for Your Bride,</l><l>For the fulfillment</l><l>Of Your economy.</l></lg>
